{{Quote|{{Green|Is that even a fish? It's the Carrot King!}}}}
The '''Carrot King''' is a {{Rare}} [[Sea Creature]] that has a chance to be caught in [[Water]] while using [[Carrot Bait]].

== Spawning ==
'''Carrot King''' has a {{Chance|5%|1|20|sea creatures}} base chance to override other Sea Creature spawns while using {{Item|Carrot Bait}} in water with {{Skill|Fishing|14}} or higher. Currently there are no modifiers that can be used to increase it.

